      "name": "Hideous Cacophony",
      "category": "passive",
      "placement": "traits",
      "activity": null,
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "The shoggoth's many mouths constantly emit whistles, fluting, and other high-pitched noises. It has disadvantage on Dexterity (Stealth) checks made to be unheard. Each creature that starts its turn within 60 feet of the shoggoth and that can hear it must make a DC 19 Wisdom saving throw or be disoriented until the start of its next turn. A disoriented creature is incapacitated, and when it moves, it moves in a random direction."
      ],
